  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I would like to suggest adding RU servers, the Russian segment of the VRChat community is not so small and also contributes to the community. For example, I am Russian and I know English very poorly, the only server where I can get to know Russian speakers is \"Pyaterochka\" (Пятёрочка), but as everyone knows, there are a lot of inadequate people there, I would like to find some interesting worlds and see the RU servers so that I can confidently go there, knowing that I can meet new people without being afraid of my language limitations. I ask you to at least add a language filter for worlds, if it is not possible to host a server in Russia, I am sure that many people would like such functionality, especially those who know only 1 language.",
